WEBVTT

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:05.850
Would you... help me out at ABCB tomorrow?

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:09.450
Darling... you're acting strange today!

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:11.700
Oniichan, you take care of the rest!

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:16.530
Ayukawa asked me to help out because she wanted to make these together...

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.490
D...Did you eat the chocolates?

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:26.760
H...Hikaru!

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:50.160
On usual, precious nights,
I'd be riding by your side...

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:56.230
...as you take me in your car for a ride.

00:00:56.230 --> 00:01:01.030
I hung up the phone,
when you called to cancel the date...

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:08.140
...I tried to pretend that there wasn't a scent of lie.

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:14.050
The color of my manicure, as it dries...

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:19.420
...only serves to glamorize this night...

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:20.020
A-ha-ha...

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:22.920
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:25.920
Got to be more straightforward to say it...

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:30.600
...but uncertainty whispers into my ear...

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.060
'Cause I love you...

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:34.830
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:37.800
each time I act, the truth leaves further...

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:43.110
...and further from my face. You've broken my heart.

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:43.940
A-HA-HA

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:46.810
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:49.780
Got to be able to cry...

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:54.520
...but my pride keeps revising my dialogue...

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:55.950
'Cause I love you...

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:58.890
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:01.830
There's no turning back now that I've realized...

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:08.790
...the seriousness of the crime. You've broken my heart.

00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:25.660
The Taste of Love?
Kyosuke's Hellish Valentine.

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:36.040
"Tomorrow?"

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:38.070
"Yeah. Can you help me out at ABCB?"
"Tomorrow?"

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:39.130
"Sure. That's fine..."
"Yeah. Can you help me out at ABCB?"

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:39.210
"Sure. That's fine..."

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:41.980
"But, seeing that it'll be Valentine's Day,
maybe you're busy?"

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:44.090
"N...No, not at all."

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:45.790
"Good!

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:47.830
"Then, to show my appreciation for your assistance..."

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:49.880
"'Appreciation?'"

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:54.350
"Keep it 'til tomorrow."

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:57.820
"See ya..."

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:13.310
I, Kasuga Kyosuke... have high hopes for Valentine's Day this year!

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:17.280
Say, Kurumi? Did you get the whipped cream ready?

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:19.890
Gosh, you're being
too soft-hearted, Manami!

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:22.360
You've got to stop giving out "obligation chocolates!"

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:27.410
What's wrong with that?! As they say, "show your love to boys who need it!"

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:31.200
Oh! Hey! Hey, you! Kazuya!

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.630
W...Wait!

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:32.890
Phffft!
W...Wait!

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:33.990
Hey, you! Wait, why don't you?!
Phffft!

00:03:33.990 --> 00:03:35.070
Hey, you! Wait, why don't you?!

00:03:35.070 --> 00:03:37.070
Now, now! Don't run away!

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:38.910
Hey! Hey! Kazuya!

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:39.200
Oneechan!

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:41.170
Goodness! Why can't you behave?!
Oneechan!

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:41.250
Oneechan!

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:42.940
Kazuya! Why, you!

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:44.900
Kazuya!
Kazuya! Why, you!

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:49.420
Oniichan!

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:50.650
Kazuya!
Phffft!

00:03:50.650 --> 00:03:52.690
You won't catch me that easily!

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:55.080
Will you cut that out?!
Or else I'll get really angry with you!

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:08.340
Ow...

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:09.640
K...Kazuya!

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:12.110
Oh, gee! Gosh, Kazuya,
got a cavity or something?

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:15.880
It's because you don't brush your teeth
after eating all that candy!

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:18.910
Oniichan, you take care of things from here!

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:23.440
Take care of things...?! Why, you...

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:27.220
See? What did I tell you?

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:29.790
You'll come down with a fever if you don't
get that yanked out right now!

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:30.980
D...Dad!

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:32.080
D... What?!
D...Dad!

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.680
Er... Well...
D... What?!

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:33.760
Er... Well...

00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:38.130
I...I mean... well, you see,
I'm not Kazuya... I'm Kyosuke, so...

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:41.400
Kazuya! Listen to what my Dad tells you!

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:44.540
My goodness! I'll have to ask one of my friends to see you!

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:46.470
You're such a burden!

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:48.490
W...Well, like I told you, I'm...
You're such a burden!

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:53.270
And I've got a previous engagement with Ayukawa...

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:57.940
Aha... Yuusaku, the chocolate did harden, right?

00:04:58.410 --> 00:05:00.920
Yeah. Perfectly! So far so good!

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:04.880
Now, then... It's "Hikaru Time!"

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:07.850
Really, Hikaru, it's so typical of you to do things like this!

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:13.000
Like, making Valentine's Day chocolate with the recipient!

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:16.030
Truly, it's "home-made love," if you will!

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:25.440
"This... is from my heart..."

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:30.840
"Hikaru... you have
feelings for me, after all..."

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:34.310
"Yuusaku... you will accept this from me, won't you?"

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:37.760
"O...Of course, Hikaru..."

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:40.650
"Th... Thank you..."

00:05:41.720 --> 00:05:43.820
What are you doing, Yuusaku?

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:46.750
That's an important chocolate, one I want Darling to enjoy!

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:02.320
Do you know what day today is?

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:04.840
Nah... Nah...

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:08.260
You see, it's the day when girls...

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:11.460
...give certain things to boys.

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:12.960
Huh...? Huh...?

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:16.000
You know? It's something that you eat
that begins with "ch."

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.920
Yo! Kyosuke!

00:06:18.860 --> 00:06:20.700
I'm amazed that you'd stoop this low...

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:23.470
...just 'cuz you aren't getting
any chocolates! Only you, Kyosuke!

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:25.530
Really! Really!

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:30.700
Y...You're talking about me, huh?

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:32.970
C'mon, stop fooling around here!
Y...You're talking about me, huh?

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:33.050
Y...You're talking about me, huh?

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:34.580
Why don't you come with us?!

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:36.230
"Come with you?" Where to?

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:39.320
Where else?! The school! School!

00:06:39.320 --> 00:06:39.480
School?!

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:41.450
Yup! Yup! Yup!
School?!

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:48.090
Good morning!

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:49.390
Oh! Good morning!
Good morning!

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:49.470
Good morning!

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:51.520
You're in awfully early today!

00:06:54.360 --> 00:06:57.330
A-ha... A Valentine's Day
"On-the-House" Special, eh?

00:06:58.130 --> 00:06:59.630
Lemme see now...

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:02.570
No you don't. They're all accounted for!
Lemme see now...

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:06.270
Not even an "obligation chocolate" for me?

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:11.120
Still... maybe that's what it's all about...

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:12.610
What do you mean?

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:14.010
W...Well... What I mean is that...
What do you mean?

00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:14.090
What do you mean?

00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:16.190
...a girl like you, Madoka, might...

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:19.220
...only give such things to someone who's really important to you.

00:07:20.090 --> 00:07:23.860
G...Gosh... B...But... these are...

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:25.270
Oh!

00:07:25.270 --> 00:07:27.000
See?

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:29.840
Some people get bashful
when they're hiding something!

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:31.900
Master!

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:35.870
"No Hot Chocolate today!"

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:37.340
Oh my!
"No Hot Chocolate today!"

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:41.650
Huh? Oh, that! Well, you know that the chocolates will be...

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:44.040
...given out, on the house, so...

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:47.190
Oh, I see.

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:50.190
Oh, as I recall, Kasuga is
supposed to be helping out today...

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:52.220
Oh! Er...

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:54.650
I don't care anymore!

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:56.620
Well...
I don't care anymore!

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:11.280
My... thank you for your help...

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:14.140
I feel awful, imposing on your day off!

00:08:18.610 --> 00:08:20.520
You're welcome anytime, you know!

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:21.980
My...

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:29.920
Still, how many years has it been since the last time you called?

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:34.200
Well... I'm sorry for doing
the Kramer vs. Kramer thing!

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:36.310
Though you seem to be in control, from what I can see.

00:08:36.310 --> 00:08:39.370
Huh? Oh, no! It takes so much out of me
that I don't know what to do!

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:42.380
Geez! This is so lame!

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:44.640
Dad's using Kazuya's cavity as an excuse...

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:48.300
...to look up one of his old lady-friends!

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:50.400
Here you go!

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:57.220
Doesn't this bring back memories!

00:08:57.220 --> 00:09:00.290
Huh... Oh! Oh, the chocolate...

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:02.320
It sure does bring back memories... from the good old days.

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:06.770
Still, you haven't changed a bit, Takashi!

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:09.140
Huh? Er... Why...

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:11.000
You haven't changed at all either!

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:13.730
And... in fact, you're even more sexy now!

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:18.580
Oh? You never complimented me
like that in the old days!

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:22.340
Huh? Oh, no! That wasn't exactly a compliment...

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:24.140
I gotta pee!

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:29.580
Oh! Okay! Why don't you just go?! Go!

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:33.460
What are you, nuts?!

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:35.600
Ayukawa is waiting for me, thank you very much!

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:39.590
Anyway, I've got to find Kazuya ASAP and switch places!

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:51.470
Jingoro, have you seen Kazuya? I mean... where's Kyosuke?

00:09:56.640 --> 00:09:58.590
Tomita, the self-proclaimed "Playboy!"

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:00.740
He can claim he's whatever,
but he's got only 2 chocolates!

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:02.820
Gee...

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:07.160
