not to give or receive chocolates in school!

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:10.360
That flippant Yamazaki!
Why, he got 3 chocolate bars!

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:12.900
That martial-arts-maniac Sanshiro... he's got 3 panties!

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:13.940
P...Panties?

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:19.060
I gotta say... this is very ingenious, oniic... I mean, you guys...

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:23.440
Want a bite?

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:24.930
L...Listen, you!
Want a bite?

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:25.010
Want a bite?

00:10:25.010 --> 00:10:27.050
These chocolates are not for eating!

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:29.650
