an altar and worshiped...

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:32.490
...in the hopes that we too will be blessed next year!

00:10:32.490 --> 00:10:33.410
Hatta!

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:35.240
Komatsu!
Hatta!

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:44.600
Ushiko!

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:46.530
Umao!

00:10:46.530 --> 00:10:49.300
Wherefore art thou, Ushiko?!

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:51.730
And, wherefore art thou, Umao?!

00:10:56.940 --> 00:10:59.910
Dammit, that Kazuya... where did he go?!

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:06.550
Geez! What does he think Valentine's Day is for?!

00:11:06.550 --> 00:11:08.920
For boys like us, boys with pure,
innocent hearts...

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:10.760
...Valentine's Day is diabolical, isn't it?!

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:14.230
Customs like this one...
ought to be immediately eliminated!

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:17.800
That, you see... is our duty! Right, Comrade Hatta?

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:19.840
Right, Comrade Komatsu! Right!

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:23.170
Huh? Do you understand now, Kasuga?!

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:25.230
I don't get it.

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:28.390
Yippee... Darling!

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:31.670
I was looking everywhere for you!

00:11:33.570 --> 00:11:37.010
D...D... D...Darling?

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:40.990
Darling...

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:50.750
Darling... somehow, you seem strange today...

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:55.570
D...Did you already eat some chocolate?!

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:56.830
Y...Yeah...

00:11:56.830 --> 00:11:59.800
Wh...Who did you get them from?
Y...Yeah...

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:03.000
Hey! This ain't good!

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:03.830
W...We're outta here! Later!
Hey! This ain't good!

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:06.200
Yeah. Let's...Let's do that!
W...We're outta here! Later!

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:06.280
Yeah. Let's...Let's do that!

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:09.340
Who did you get it from, Darling?!

00:12:13.550 --> 00:12:18.070
I worked so hard to make you
a chocolate, Darling...

00:12:27.490 --> 00:12:29.410
H...Hikaru!

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:31.660
Who gives a damn about...

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:48.190
A...Awful... Darling, this is awful...

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:49.320
This is awful...

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:50.620
Hikaru!
This is awful...

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:04.170
You bastard! She worked
on it so hard, and all for you!

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:28.420
"Kasuga Kyosuke..."

00:13:39.070 --> 00:13:41.940
Just what's he... really up to...?

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:47.510
Well, now... Work! Work!

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:51.190
Oh?

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:53.760
Kazuya...

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:57.160
So I couldn't...
get back to being the real me...

00:13:57.160 --> 00:14:00.830
...but, I had to keep
my appointment with Ayukawa...

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:06.910
For the time being, I was without a doubt
a completely lost little kid...

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:08.470
Here.

00:14:08.470 --> 00:14:10.060
Here you go, Kazuya.

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:14.270
A...Ayukawa... I mean... Madoka-oneechan...

00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:18.230
Oh? What... don't you like chocolate, Kazuya?

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:22.520
Er... Well... Of course I do...

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:24.910
Then, why so modest?!

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:30.800
Oh! You lucky boy! Kazuya, you see...

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:33.320
...not many non-customers get to have
one of those chocolates!

00:14:33.730 --> 00:14:34.790
M... Master!

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:37.060
Well!
M... Master!

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:37.140
M... Master!

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:39.200
I don't care anymore!

00:14:42.030 --> 00:14:45.040
Ayukawa asked me to help out...

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:48.440
...because she wanted
to make these together...

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:53.440
Gee, why that...

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:57.880
Kazuya, do you know where Kasuga is?

00:14:58.280 --> 00:15:00.310
Huh? Er... I, er...

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:04.730
Really, he's got some nerve!

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:08.360
Y...You know,
I think he went out with Hikaru!

00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:11.290
What? He's with her, then?

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:13.590
Uh-huh...

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:19.370
Hikaru...

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:24.480
Madoka!

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:26.670
Darling has... Darling has...

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:29.660
Madoka!

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:30.420
Hikaru!

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:33.350
Have you any idea what he's done?!

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:38.180
Wait!

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:09.530
Here you go! All done, Kazuya!

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:11.580
Next, we'll do your pants!

00:16:12.590 --> 00:16:14.820
Huh...? Kazuya?

00:16:15.630 --> 00:16:17.100
Now I've got no choice...

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:19.360
...I've got to switch places with Kazuya or else!

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:50.130
O...On the other hand... it's because
I'm a kid, I can be in a place like this!

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:53.000
"Who's there?"

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:57.410
"Why, it's you, Kazuya!

00:16:57.410 --> 00:17:00.840
"Come on in. Come take a shower with this oneechan here!"

00:17:01.170 --> 00:17:03.510
"W... Wh... Yikes!"

00:17:07.150 --> 00:17:10.120
"Don't be so nervous!"

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:30.060
Gosh, Kazuya! So this is where you were!

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:36.830
Okay, now! We've got to dry your pants.

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:46.660
Oh my!

00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:50.100
Right! Aha! Uh-huh!

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:51.920
I see!

00:17:54.660 --> 00:17:56.860
Uh-huh-huh...

00:17:57.500 --> 00:17:58.670
Oh, eyeew! Eyeew!

00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:00.610
Oh, my goodness! I don't believe this!

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:02.630
Oh, gee!

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:06.510
My!

00:18:06.510 --> 00:18:09.570
What's going on, Hikaru?

00:18:10.910 --> 00:18:13.880
Cuz... Cuz... Cuz...

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:18.950
My, Hikaru! You're embarrassing Kazuya!

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:23.260
But it's... the first time I've ever seen one!

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:26.800
Isn't this your first time too, Madoka? Well?!

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:28.770
Dummy!

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:33.160
I, Kasuga Kyosuke... was seen butt naked!

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:38.210
Is that for real, Hikaru?
Now that's really awful of Kasuga!

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:42.570
You think so too, right?
It's just too awful, even for Darling!

00:18:43.380 --> 00:18:46.040
I think so too. He completely forgot a previous appointment we'd made.

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:51.360
What? M...Madoka, did you have something arranged for today?

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:54.030
Huh? Oh! N...No!

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:55.950
Nothing important, really...

00:18:56.560 --> 00:18:59.470
Oh! B...But, you know, oneechans...

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:02.430
Maybe something came up with Kyosuke-oniichan!

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:05.040
Something came up?!

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:07.970
But, it's the once-a-year
Valentine's Day, for crying out loud...

00:19:07.970 --> 00:19:10.740
...when shy damsels who can't usually say
"I love you! I love you..."

00:19:10.740 --> 00:19:15.650
Well, it's the day when they can finally confess their love!

00:19:15.650 --> 00:19:19.770
Hikaru! Kazuya can't understand things like that yet!

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:22.210
Oh, that's right!

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:27.080
Anyway, I just can't believe that guy... He's not going to get away with this!

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:30.700
That's right! This time, he's managed to completely trash...

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:33.570
...my pure and innocent heart!

00:19:33.570 --> 00:19:36.960
Still, please take it easy on him, okay, Madoka?

00:19:37.460 --> 00:19:39.410
Right! She's right!

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:41.690
I can't! I won't forgive him,
no matter what!

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:46.480
Oniichan! Oniichan!

00:19:46.480 --> 00:19:48.070
K...Kazuya!

00:19:48.070 --> 00:19:48.900
Huh? Oh?
K...Kazuya!

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:48.980
K...Kazuya!

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:51.590
Oh? Do you need to go
to the bathroom, Kazuya?

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:53.880
Do you want me to go with you?

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:55.120
Wh...?!

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:58.920
Oh, no! N... It's nothing, really!

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:00.090
Yahoo!

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:00.550
Huh?
Yahoo!

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:02.520
Ayukawa?!
Huh?

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:02.890
Ayukawa?!

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:03.020
What the...

00:20:03.020 --> 00:20:03.350
Are you here?
What the...

00:20:03.350 --> 00:20:04.790
Kasuga!
Are you here?

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:08.870
I was told that Kazuya is with you...

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:11.190
Yoohoo! Darling!

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:12.700
Hikaru!

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:15.770
Oh! That's right... That's right!

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:18.080
Uh-huh! He won't be forgiven!

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:19.650
B...Bad news!

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:22.970
I've gotta switch back, or else!

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:27.490
Oniichan!

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:30.610
K...Kazuya! O...Ow...

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:34.140
Oh! Oniichan, you didn't get your tooth pulled out yet!

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:37.030
Darling...

00:20:37.030 --> 00:20:38.090
Kasuga...

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:40.730
Well, it's a good thing
I've found him at last!

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:43.320
'Cuz I've gotta take him to the dentist!

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:47.470
Now, wait, Kasuga... Don't you have something to tell us before you go?

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:49.140
That's right, Darling!

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:50.610
All we need is a word from you, like...

00:20:50.610 --> 00:20:53.450
"I'm sorry about before...
What happened back there, it wasn't me..."

00:20:53.450 --> 00:20:55.270
Then I can forgive you just like that!

00:20:55.740 --> 00:20:59.140
What are you talking about?! This is all your fault, Hikaru!

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:02.960
I... I...

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:04.850
I'm sorry, Darling!

00:21:05.550 --> 00:21:06.350
You idiot!

00:21:06.350 --> 00:21:08.050
I, for one, won't forgive you!
You idiot!

00:21:08.050 --> 00:21:08.130
You idiot!

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:10.930
Look how messed up my scarf is!
Explain that!

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:14.320
Oh! The scarf... It's Madoka's!

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:19.440
Who else has the gall to do
the kind of things... that you do?!

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:21.210
Now, now, relax!

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:23.010
Oh, yeah! Where's my chocolates?

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:25.080
I haven't gotten one from you,
Ayukawa, y'know!

00:21:25.080 --> 00:21:27.950
Madoka... Forgive me...

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:30.770
But, it's my fault that he's acting this way.

00:21:31.280 --> 00:21:34.420
And yet... this once,
I won't let him get away with it!

00:21:34.420 --> 00:21:36.450
I'm sorry, Darling!

00:21:39.220 --> 00:21:40.350
Hikaru!

00:21:40.350 --> 00:21:42.320
K...K...Kazuya!
Hikaru!

00:21:46.430 --> 00:21:48.830
Pardon me.

00:22:01.870 --> 00:22:03.850
In that case, I'll take you up
on your kind offer...

00:22:03.850 --> 00:22:06.080
...and let Kasuga handle the rest!

00:22:06.080 --> 00:22:07.490
Please! Please!

00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:10.790
Apparently he REALLY wants to atone for his bad behavior!

00:22:10.790 --> 00:22:12.370
A...Ayukawa...

00:22:12.920 --> 00:22:14.090
Well, Master...

00:22:14.090 --> 00:22:16.550
I'm sure that your wife is waiting for you
at home with some chocolates!

00:22:17.720 --> 00:22:20.690
My! You always have
the upper hand, Madoka!

00:22:24.600 --> 00:22:27.030
Well, then... if you'll excuse me!

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:34.250
Looks like... I didn't get any chocolate...

00:22:34.250 --> 00:22:37.370
...for Valentine's Day again this year!

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:42.750
Hot chocolate?

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:44.820
D...Don't get the wrong idea now!

00:22:44.820 --> 00:22:47.260
It's just that there's some hot chocolate left over...

00:22:47.260 --> 00:22:49.260
...so that's why I'm giving it to you.

00:22:49.260 --> 00:22:51.320
Uh-huh...

00:22:54.830 --> 00:22:56.740
Oops, I forgot something.

00:22:56.740 --> 00:23:00.200
Huh...? Something smells good!

00:23:02.130 --> 00:23:07.370
Oh? As I recall, there wasn't going to be
any hot chocolate served today.

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:12.310
M...Master! Hurry up and go home!

00:23:14.310 --> 00:23:16.510
Well then, take your time!

00:23:23.760 --> 00:23:29.190
That means... this must've... come from Ayukawa's heart.

00:23:49.980 --> 00:23:58.500
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:23:58.500 --> 00:24:02.370
At a train station on a faraway day...

00:24:02.370 --> 00:24:14.080
...snowflakes dance on the platform,
and you came running, out of breath.

00:24:14.080 --> 00:24:19.850
The days we had to be apart made the memory of you...

00:24:19.850 --> 00:24:28.190
...a happy one, like seeing your photograph.

00:24:28.190 --> 00:24:35.730
"I just dance in the sweet memories" Each time we're hurt we learn...

00:24:35.730 --> 00:24:43.380
"I just dance in the sweet memories" ...what it takes to love someone.

00:24:43.380 --> 00:24:51.020
"I just dance in the sweet memories"
(He's my one and only; you never can tell)

00:24:51.020 --> 00:24:58.560
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:24:58.560 --> 00:25:04.580
"I just dance in the sweet memories"

00:25:13.170 --> 00:25:16.910
After Hikaru died, I...
realized for the first time...

00:25:16.910 --> 00:25:21.080
...that her cheerfulness was
what bonded everyone together.

00:25:21.080 --> 00:25:23.820
I'll never say "I'd be embarrassed to exchange diaries" again...

00:25:23.820 --> 00:25:25.380
...so, please, come back to life once more!

00:25:25.380 --> 00:25:29.310
Next time: "Hikaru Passes Away; And Then There Were None."
